{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:43:46+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alien Paradise", "steam_appid": 2818440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3147110], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this rhythm game, one of the greatest questions of the universe is finally answered: what would happen if an extraterrestrial being went to Brazil for their vacations?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the alien guest to do touristic, cultural and commonplace activities to the country. Memorize the animations, press the buttons in the rhythm of the songs and create an unforgettable journey to our dearest e.t. friend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/extras/407ede2cde38edd5db39879a47169a24.poster.avif?t=1789752284\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/extras/407ede2cde38edd5db39879a47169a24.webm?t=1789752284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/extras/407ede2cde38edd5db39879a47169a24.mp4?t=1789752284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your rhythmic abilities in more than 30 levels, each one of them representing a touristic, cultural or ordinary activity the alien wanted to do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the scoring difficulty that better suits your playing style. Normal Mode is ideal for those who aren’t familiar with rhythm games, while Hard Mode demands more precision and attention from the player. Improve your precision to better score and get up to three stars, representing your performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, face the travel journal: a special level that interpolates between some of the activities played until that point. Get ready to test your memory and, more than ever, your attention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/extras/c8e83afbd95b611fb94270b1e5fa6ee1.avif?t=1789752284\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/extras_big/c8e83afbd95b611fb94270b1e5fa6ee1.webp?t=1789752284 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this rhythm game, one of the greatest questions of the universe is finally answered: what would happen if an extraterrestrial being went to Brazil for their vacations?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the alien guest to do touristic, cultural and commonplace activities to the country. Memorize the animations, press the buttons in the rhythm of the songs and create an unforgettable journey to our dearest e.t. friend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/extras/407ede2cde38edd5db39879a47169a24.poster.avif?t=1789752284\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/extras/407ede2cde38edd5db39879a47169a24.webm?t=1789752284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/extras/407ede2cde38edd5db39879a47169a24.mp4?t=1789752284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your rhythmic abilities in more than 30 levels, each one of them representing a touristic, cultural or ordinary activity the alien wanted to do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the scoring difficulty that better suits your playing style. Normal Mode is ideal for those who aren’t familiar with rhythm games, while Hard Mode demands more precision and attention from the player. Improve your precision to better score and get up to three stars, representing your performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, face the travel journal: a special level that interpolates between some of the activities played until that point. Get ready to test your memory and, more than ever, your attention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/extras/c8e83afbd95b611fb94270b1e5fa6ee1.avif?t=1789752284\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/extras_big/c8e83afbd95b611fb94270b1e5fa6ee1.webp?t=1789752284 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Help an extraterrestrial being to enjoy their staying on Planet Earth in this rhythm game.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/header.jpg?t=1789752284", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1789752284", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1789752284", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 3.3+<br></li><li><strong>Stora